## **11. Student lifecycle and portal states**

The portal should change based on the student's academic lifecycle.

| Lifecycle state      | Portal behaviour                                    |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| Invited              | Account activation page                             |
| Activated            | First login and password setup                      |
| Profile incomplete   | Profile completion workflow                         |
| Admitted             | Admission information and onboarding                |
| Registration pending | Registration submission and tracking                |
| Active               | Full authorised student dashboard                   |
| Deferred             | Deferment status and resumption instructions        |
| Suspended            | Restricted access and official notices              |
| Completed            | Completion and clearance information                |
| Graduated            | Alumni and certificate services                     |
| Withdrawn            | Restricted historical records and relevant services |

Do not grant academic services simply because an account exists. Account activation, student admission, academic registration and active enrolment are distinct states.

