### **Access control rules**

1. Students only access their own records.
2. Lecturers access students in their assigned teaching groups.
3. Department Heads access authorised departmental records.
4. Finance staff access authorised finance records, not confidential counselling records.
5. HR staff access authorised employment records.
6. Results approval is separated from mark entry.
7. Super Admin technical privileges do not automatically grant access to confidential business records.
8. Every sensitive action is audited.
9. APIs validate permissions independently of the frontend.
10. File downloads enforce the same record-level permissions as page views.

