- Mobile layout works at supported widths.
- All buttons perform their advertised actions.
- Loading, empty, success and error states exist.
- Forms validate on client and server.
- Permissions are enforced on the API.
- Data comes from real API endpoints, not hardcoded demo values.
- Sensitive data is not exposed in logs or browser storage.
- Keyboard navigation works.
- WCAG 2.2 AA checks are completed.
- Unit and integration tests pass.
- Existing functionality remains intact.
- Database migrations are reviewed and tested before deployment.

